 519:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h **** /** \brief API to Check if the clock counter has a sticky overflow condition.
 520:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  *
 521:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  * This API can be used to get sticky overflow bit of clock counter of only the caller CPU.
 522:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  * It cannot be used for this activity towards other CPUs.
 523:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  * This API also clears the sticky overflow after the read. While reading the sticky bit this API d
 524:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  * the counter for short time. (otherwise sticky bit cannot be cleared). This API shall be used aft
 525:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  *
 526:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  * \return Status of sticky overflow bit.
 527:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  *
 528:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  * \retval TRUE:  Sticky overflow bit is set.
 529:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  * \retval FALSE: Sticky overflow bit is reset.
 530:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  */
 531:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h **** IFX_INLINE boolean IfxCpu_getClockCounterStickyOverflow(void);
 532:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h **** 
