 669:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Port/Std/IfxPort.h **** /** \brief Enable the emergency stop function.
 670:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Port/Std/IfxPort.h ****  * This function enables the emergency stop function. No check is done on port functionality.
 671:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Port/Std/IfxPort.h ****  *
 672:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Port/Std/IfxPort.h ****  * \param[inout] port     Pointer to the port which should be accessed.
