 735:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Port/Std/IfxPort.h **** /** \brief Modifies the Pin Controller Selection.
 736:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Port/Std/IfxPort.h ****  *
 737:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Port/Std/IfxPort.h ****  * \param[inout] port     Pointer to the base of specified port's SFRs.
